% 02_key_and_accidentals.abc -- audible test: a tune in E-flat major,
% exercising key-signature-implied accidentals (E-flat major = B,E,A
% flatted) plus an explicit inline accidental overriding the key (^A,
% a natural-contradicting sharp on the second line) and an explicit
% natural (=B) cancelling the key's own flat for one note.
X:1
T:Flat Key Test
M:3/4
L:1/8
K:Eb
E2 G2 B2 | c2 B2 A2 | ^A2 =B2 G2 | E6 |]
